[00:02.55]Okay, it's time to get it straight with you
{"好吧　是时候和你坦诚相待了"}
[00:07.37]I'm trying to tell a truth or to be honest
{"我想说出真相　或者说实话"}
[00:10.54]I've been feeling like a ton of bricks
{"我感觉像被千钧重担压着"}
[00:13.51]I can be such a prick (b.i.t.c.h)
{"我有时真是个混蛋"}
[00:15.83]I'm sorry, thanks for being here
{"对不起　谢谢你一直在这里"}
[00:17.75]Nobody ever listens to me
{"从来没有人愿意听我说话"}
[00:29.74]Emily loves her job and she loves her health (care)
{"艾米丽热爱她的工作和健康事业"}
[00:37.56]She says it feels good, to love just a little bit of yourself
{"她说爱自己一点点感觉很好"}
[00:43.13]I know she's right but it's hard to tell
{"我知道她是对的但很难说清"}
[00:45.55]Cause I wouldn't know how it feels
{"因为我从未体会过那种感受"}
[00:48.34]Do you cry yourself to sleep sometimes?
{"你有时会哭着入睡吗"}
[00:51.22]You can't win
{"你赢不了的"}
[00:56.85]Don't waste my time, telling stories
{"别浪费我时间讲那些故事"}
[01:01.38]I've wasted mine. An endless fight
{"我已浪费了太多　无尽的争斗"}
[01:05.00]Now it's been ten years standing at the bus stop
{"如今已在公交站台站了十年"}
[01:07.63]Never had a real job
{"从未有过正经工作"}
[01:08.68]Never had anything on a plate
{"盘中从未盛过像样的饭菜"}
[01:11.11]It's a shame
{"真是可悲"}
[01:12.45]It's not the things you know
{"重要的不是你知道什么"}
[01:13.99]It's the friends you make
{"而是你结交的朋友"}
[01:24.08]And Jack didn't know shit
{"而杰克根本什么都不懂"}
[01:26.40]He got far but he didn't know when to quit
{"他走得很远却不知何时收手"}
[01:28.67]Showing off but he's gotta get a grip, yeah
{"炫耀成性但他必须清醒点"}
[01:32.96]But Jack just can't live without it
{"但杰克就是离不开这种生活"}
[01:35.20]Don't be a man about it now
{"现在别装作男子汉了"}
[01:37.45]If you hold it in, you gotta let it out
{"若你压抑在心 就该释放情绪"}
[01:39.83]You gotta help yourself, put the bottle down
{"你得自救 放下手中酒瓶"}
[01:42.65]If you try, you might like what you find
{"若你尝试 或许会爱上这发现"}
[01:45.57]Just saying
{"只是说说"}
[01:51.16]Don't waste my time, telling stories
{"别浪费我时间 讲那些故事"}
[01:55.60]I've wasted mine. An endless fight
{"我已虚度光阴 无尽争斗中"}
[01:59.20]Now it's been ten years standing at the bus stop
{"如今已在公交站台伫立十年"}
[02:01.48]Never had a real job
{"从未有过正经工作"}
[02:02.76]Never had anything on a plate
{"盘中从未盛过像样餐食"}
[02:05.26]It's a shame
{"真是遗憾"}
