{"重要的不是学识"}
[02:07.79]It's the friends you make
{"而是结交的挚友"}
[02:18.31]Everybody else
{"其他所有人"}
[02:20.25]Everybody only talks about themselves
{"都只顾谈论自己"}
[02:27.26]Have you ever felt lost in the window?
{"可曾感到在橱窗中迷失？"}
[02:31.13]Desperate to be loved but just being thrown out?
{"渴望被爱却总遭抛弃？"}
